      "content": "SP 80 SE              THE LEE              THE LEE                                            (north side) 4/101                                      The Old Cottage - GV                                          II                                        Small house.  C17 and C18. Timber framed, recased in C18 brick.  Old tile roof.  Four bays, two storeys with eaves breaking gabled first floor windows.  Paired casements  with segmental arches to ground floor.  Central eight panel door.  Timber posts-rendered over at right, end stacks. Listing NGR: SP8999204296"
    }
